      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "针对静态提示词管理记忆易误判冲突、RAG 粗召回噪声干扰推理两大痛点，引入端到端结果驱动 RL",
      "lineHeight": 1.36,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
