      "text": "2. 两阶段输入构成",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 两阶段输入构成",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0034",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 743.1,
      "width": 1333.4,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1916010461,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 128698575,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Memory Manager 输入：当前对话轮次抽出的新候选信息 + 从已有记忆库检索出的相关旧记忆集合；\n• Answer Agent 输入：用户查询问题 + 相似度 RAG 召回的 60 条候选记忆集合。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Memory Manager 输入：当前对话轮次抽出的新候选信息 + 从已有记忆库检索出的相关旧记忆集合；\n• Answer Agent 输入：用户查询问题 + 相似度 RAG 召回的 60 条候选记忆集合。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
