      "text": "4. 存储形式与结果驱动 RL 训练机制",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. 存储形式与结果驱动 RL 训练机制",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0040",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 1361.1,
      "width": 2207.6,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1105654384,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1585057583,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 存储形式：外部自然语言事实记忆库 + 向量检索索引（延续 Mem0 结构）；\n• 极简监督信号：全程不需要人工标注每步记忆操作标签，直接以最终答案的精确匹配（Exact Match, EM）作为唯一标量奖励，分别采用 PPO 或 GRPO 微调两个智能体。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 存储形式：外部自然语言事实记忆库 + 向量检索索引（延续 Mem0 结构）；\n• 极简监督信号：全程不需要人工标注每步记忆操作标签，直接以最终答案的精确匹配（Exact Match, EM）作为唯一标量奖励，分别采用 PPO 或 GRPO 微调两个智能体。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
