      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "由 RL 训练后的 Memory Manager 自主\n判定何时执行 DELETE 物理移除错误或\n失效条目，避免静态提示词常见的误删覆\n盖问题。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "由 RL 训练后的 Memory Manager 自主\n判定何时执行 DELETE 物理移除错误或\n失效条目，避免静态提示词常见的误删覆\n盖问题。",
      "lineHeight": 1.56,
      "autoResize": true
    },
