      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "原论文核心实证结论（LoCoMo / MSC / LongMemEval）",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原论文核心实证结论（LoCoMo / MSC / LongMemEval）",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0089",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 92,
      "y": 2781.1,
      "width": 2292.7,
      "height": 174.7,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1721313861,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1959327076,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 极低数据成本大幅提分：仅使用 152 条训练 QA 对与对应时序记忆库微调，在 LoCoMo 上以 LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 为基座时，Memory-R1-GRPO 相比强基线 Mem0 取得相\n  对提升 F1 +28%、BLEU-1 +34%、LLM-as-a-Judge +30%；\n• 跨基准与跨尺寸泛化：在 LoCoMo、MSC、LongMemEval 三个基准以及 3B~14B 多尺寸模型上均稳定超越静态记忆基线，且纯结果 EM 奖励比强加中间 `<memory>` 抽取监督更\n  稳健。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 极低数据成本大幅提分：仅使用 152 条训练 QA 对与对应时序记忆库微调，在 LoCoMo 上以 LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 为基座时，Memory-R1-GRPO 相比强基线 Mem0 取得相\n  对提升 F1 +28%、BLEU-1 +34%、LLM-as-a-Judge +30%；\n• 跨基准与跨尺寸泛化：在 LoCoMo、MSC、LongMemEval 三个基准以及 3B~14B 多尺寸模型上均稳定超越静态记忆基线，且纯结果 EM 奖励比强加中间 `<memory>` 抽取监督更\n  稳健。",
      "lineHeight": 1.56,
      "autoResize": true
    },
